{
  "subject": "Share the fun of Quizlet Gravity",
  "html": "<div><u></u><div style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#070c22;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color:#070c22\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" background=\"https://www.quizletgravity.com/assets/gravity/intro-bg@2x.jpg\" style=\"background-color:#070c22;background-image:url('https://www.quizletgravity.com/assets/gravity/intro-bg@2x.jpg');background-position:center;background-size:cover;padding:48px 20px 64px\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:560px;background:#f7f7fa;background-color:rgba(247,247,250,0.8);border:1px solid #dadce5;border-radius:12px\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:32px 28px\">__EMAIL_BRAND__<h1 style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;margin:28px 0 20px\">You’re part of the beginning.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px\">Hi there,</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px\">Thank you for being one of the first people to use <strong>Quizlet Gravity</strong>. Your support means a lot to me, and I’d love your help spreading the word!</p><h2 style=\"font-size:20px;color:#4255ff;margin:28px 0 12px\">Share the fun of learning</h2><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px\">If you enjoy the game, please consider sharing <a href=\"https://www.quizletgravity.com\" style=\"color:#4255ff;text-decoration:underline\">quizletgravity.com</a> with friends, classmates, students or pupils who might enjoy learning through play. You’ll help build our community and let more people experience the fun of Quizlet Gravity again.</p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:20px 0 24px\"><tr><td style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#4255ff\"><a href=\"https://www.quizletgravity.com/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 22px;color:#ffffff;background:#4255ff;border-radius:8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Play\" height=\"20\" src=\"cid:welcome-play.png\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;width:20px;height:20px\" width=\"20\"/>   Try Quizlet Gravity</a></td></tr></table><h2 style=\"font-size:20px;color:#4255ff;margin:28px 0 12px\">Using an iPhone, iPad or Mac?</h2><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:20px 0 24px\"><tr><td style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#4255ff\"><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/ch/app/quizlet-gravity-play-learn/id6831804079?l=en-GB\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 22px;color:#ffffff;background:#4255ff;border-radius:8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Apple\" height=\"20\" src=\"cid:welcome-apple.png\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;width:20px;height:20px\" width=\"20\"/>   Download on the App Store</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px;color:#586380\">I’d appreciate a rating on the App Store. It helps more people discover Quizlet Gravity.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:20px;color:#4255ff;margin:28px 0 12px\">Try the Android app</h2><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px\">We’re preparing for a public Google Play release, subject to completing testing and Google’s review. If you’d like to try the Android app early, you’re welcome to join the test below.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px\">Use the <strong>same Google account</strong> for all three steps:</p><ol style=\"padding-left:24px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 20px\"><li><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/g/quizletgravity-android-testers\" style=\"color:#4255ff;text-decoration:underline\">Join the tester group</a></li><li><a href=\"https://play.google.com/apps/testing/com.quizletgravity.android\" style=\"color:#4255ff;text-decoration:underline\">Join the app test</a></li><li><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.quizletgravity.android\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Get it on Google Play\" height=\"80\" src=\"cid:welcome-google-play-badge.png\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;width:208px;height:80px\" width=\"208\"/></a></li></ol><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px\"><strong>A quick note about access:</strong> After completing steps 1 and 2, access to the download link in step 3 may take an hour or even a few hours to become available. If the link doesn’t work straight away, please try again later using the same Google account you used to join the group and the test. If you’re still having trouble after a few hours, just reply and I’ll help.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px\">Please try a few games. If any step doesn’t work, just reply and I’ll help.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:20px;color:#4255ff;margin:28px 0 12px\">How does the transparent keyboard feel?</h2><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px\">I’d especially love your feedback on the transparent keyboard on mobile. Can you comfortably read the asteroids behind it, and does typing feel natural? Replies, suggestions and bug reports are all welcome.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px\">Thanks for being here from the beginning!</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px\"><strong>Marko Sarafijanovic</strong><br/>Quizlet Gravity Creator</p><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#586380;margin:24px 0 0\">Prefer not to receive invitations like this? Just reply and let me know.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
  "text": "You’re part of the beginning.\nHi there,\nThank you for being one of the first people to use\nQuizlet Gravity\n. Your support means a lot to me, and I’d love your help spreading the word!\nShare the fun of learning\nIf you enjoy the game, please consider sharing\nquizletgravity.com (https://www.quizletgravity.com)\nwith friends, classmates, students or pupils who might enjoy learning through play. You’ll help build our community and let more people experience the fun of Quizlet Gravity again.\nTry Quizlet GravityPlay (https://www.quizletgravity.com/)\nUsing an iPhone, iPad or Mac?\nDownload on the App StoreApple (https://apps.apple.com/ch/app/quizlet-gravity-play-learn/id6831804079?l=en-GB)\nI’d appreciate a rating on the App Store. It helps more people discover Quizlet Gravity.\n\nTry the Android app\nWe’re preparing for a public Google Play release, subject to completing testing and Google’s review. If you’d like to try the Android app early, you’re welcome to join the test below.\nUse the\nsame Google account\nfor all three steps:\nJoin the tester group (https://groups.google.com/g/quizletgravity-android-testers)\nJoin the app test (https://play.google.com/apps/testing/com.quizletgravity.android)\nGet it on Google Play (https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.quizletgravity.android)\nA quick note about access:\nAfter completing steps 1 and 2, access to the download link in step 3 may take an hour or even a few hours to become available. If the link doesn’t work straight away, please try again later using the same Google account you used to join the group and the test. If you’re still having trouble after a few hours, just reply and I’ll help.\nPlease try a few games. If any step doesn’t work, just reply and I’ll help.\nHow does the transparent keyboard feel?\nI’d especially love your feedback on the transparent keyboard on mobile. Can you comfortably read the asteroids behind it, and does typing feel natural? Replies, suggestions and bug reports are all welcome.\nThanks for being here from the beginning!\nMarko Sarafijanovic\nQuizlet Gravity Creator\nPrefer not to receive invitations like this? Just reply and let me know.",
